40-c0x00000000-cc", "images": ["https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTT43GwInIC55n1TGikvElcPtp7UNP195AY-AbvJtZFfbFFOdm4RCPLOvYS8EatGF37ll02t73BM6_HWuMgk-dhSFoseLfu", "https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcS27FAnBQlzIYqsdHmMC4WaRoTMjGU2brkQX5t-qZg5fArqF8tn_LxYk-kGl6-WWm_-lnWCQPTfN_VgrRVTWTiY_Tq6AmqP", "https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcStBLo0ZWSdBkiMBJ16Ij1zpA91MX2Y4vnPgcj9PRGjsK_QxvfjUCZCVYKTgRbtSABL_T3C1oBFS9KF3mvfhV5agIIt78Yu5A"]}, {"text": "The Fire Boltt Ninja Call Pro Plus offers a reliable battery backup lasting up to 5?7 days with regular usage. If you frequently use Bluetooth calling and other smart features the battery life may reduce to around 2?3 days. Its long-lasting battery ensures uninterrupted usage throughout the day.Designed to keep up with your active lifestyle this smartwatch boasts an IP67 water resistance rating. This means it can withstand splashes sweat and even a brief submersion in water", "source": "myntra.com", "rating": 5, "date": "a year ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK21xbPASPcQw9_rZuxWgPPa8s20iiSkV-g6SmRtp6s7--Qr8bhoSBlfFsqWtUvZLy8JTg=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc"}, {"text": "I've been using the Fire-Boltt Ninja Calling Pro Plus for a little while now and for the price I paid I'm genuinely impressed! which makes it really easy to see notifications even outdoors. I got the grey/slate color and it looks really sleek and comfortable on the wrist?definitely a smart casual look.The Bluetooth calling feature works surprisingly well. The speaker and mic are clear enough for quick calls when I'm walking around the house or driving so I don't always have to dig my phone out of my pocket. That's a huge convenience point for me.", "source": "myntra.com", "link": "https://www.myntra.com/reviews/21283744", "rating": 5, "date": "11 months ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK21xbPASPcQw9_rZuxWgPPa8s20iiSkV-g6SmRtp6s7--Qr8bhoSBlfFsqWtUvZLy8JTg=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc", "images": ["https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcTT43GwInIC55n1TGikvElcPtp7UNP195AY-AbvJtZFfbFFOdm4RCPLOvYS8EatGF37ll02t73BM6_HWuMgk-dhSFoseLfu", "https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcS27FAnBQlzIYqsdHmMC4WaRoTMjGU2brkQX5t-qZg5fArqF8tn_LxYk-kGl6-WWm_-lnWCQPTfN_VgrRVTWTiY_Tq6AmqP", "https://encrypted-tbn3.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcStBLo0ZWSdBkiMBJ16Ij1zpA91MX2Y4vnPgcj9PRGjsK_QxvfjUCZCVYKTgRbtSABL_T3C1oBFS9KF3mvfhV5agIIt78Yu5A"]}, {"text": "After searching almost more than 1.5 months someone suggested me to buy this firebolt brand smartwatch and after purchasing this watch i am writing this review with my heart ??. It was a great watch for those persons who are searching for a budget friendly and all featured watch.Pros:-1. It has a great look and it's super display makes it more premium look.2. It has fast BT(5.1) pairing facility.3. Battery backup is also good It works 4-5 days easily.4. It has a good music sound which looks like a small android phone? and has a good calling sound without any lagging.5. Inbuilt calculator and 3 games for your timepassing.6. Great water resistancy and i like one great feature is that you can find your phone easily with this searching sound feature.Cons:- just a little bit cons i suffer is that it was not showing low battery mode indicator though it was discharged suddenly without giving any indication.", "source": "myntra.com", "link": "https://www.myntra.com/reviews/21283744", "rating": 5, "date": "2 years ago", "icon": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/shsm/AGYqVK21xbPASPcQw9_rZuxWgPPa8s20iiSkV-g6SmRtp6s7--Qr8bhoSBlfFsqWtUvZLy8JTg=w40-h40-c0x00000000-cc", "images": ["https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcRmGnyGWblIYNGOOSIAQVUwroBFOBXXXKfBnsFy0TZX8frQveiF-fVRdO6mgC69thwg1NxSusoq_Seuoc_nZnc7Ubhsb0tDrg", "https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/shopping?q=tbn:ANd9GcQNERlDOPEYSfgCqrpZjryNXw5HBKAjvmjPWbKYTg6_eBaJtqD5OKn_QuXzNw9Etls-E87PiYcqvdZuHejFbsj1KYwiIr